Version 1.4.9 (2026-10-28)
- text edit: added onFocusLost and onEnterPressed callbacks
- dropbox: now will open upward if not enough space below
- demo: improved text edit + slider combo example to allow for empty text while editing

Version 1.4.8 (2026-10-26)
- progress bar: fixed broken init that lead to it not updating properly when values are set
- tooltips: fixed enchant capacity of 0 being shown
- tooltips: added option to show enchant use cost

Version 1.4.7 (2026-10-25)
- tooltips: fixed armor not showing enchant capacity even when enabled

Version 1.4.6 (2026-10-24)
- tooltips: added option to show melee info (reach + speed)

Version 1.4.5 (2026-10-23)
- tooltips: fixed magic effects missing area info

Version 1.4.4 (2026-10-21)
- tooltips: fixed tooltip vertical flip point when UI is scaled
- fixed error if tooltip provider returns nil
- item grid and list: onListClicked now also receives item and index if click was on item and not empty space

Version 1.4.3 (2026-10-17)
- window manager: on open returns handler in addition to window
- window manager: do not restore size if window is not resizable
- image button: added option to not colorize icon and option to have background highlight
- tooltips:
  - extracted settings to a separate page
  - import settings from old page
  - added option to show soul capacity for soul gems
  - added option to show enchant capacity

Version 1.4.2 (2026-10-16)
- tooltips: setTooltip accepts provider function
- config util: added getFirstKeyboardInput variant of getFirstControllerInput
- added option to pass scroll step to item grid, list and sorted list

Version 1.4.1 (2026-10-15)
- window: added setters for position and size
- window: enforce min size on open, resize or min size change
- dropbox: fixed doubled click sound
- tooltips: default, text and paragraph items can have text color customized

Version 1.4.0 (2026-10-11)
- bumped API version to 5
- added Item Grid component
- UIToolkit.texture now can accept openmw.ui.TextureResourceOptions in place of path, so it can be used as a direct replacement for `ui.texture`
- tooltips:
  - added `owned` property to tooltips - when set, it overrides the ownership check for the owned-objects box template
  - added option to display soul size in tooltips
  - `image` property of tooltip recipes (header/banner/value) can now be TextureResourceOptions, not just a path
  - tooltip icons now go through the toolkit's texture cache
- column list item:
  - column configs can specify an `update` function called to update a column in-place instead of re-rendering;
    stock text/icon columns fall back to built-in `updateText` / `updateIcon` updaters
  - added `markColumnDirty` / `markAllDirty` / `markCacheDirty` methods to defer column refreshes until the view is next requested
- window: fixed clamping to screen that allowed windows to get out of bounds on the right and bottom
- script context: added `hasTypes` method (true in global/local/player contexts)
- debug: added `scripts/UIToolkit/debug/measure.lua` time-measure helper (start/finish in milliseconds)

Version 1.3.0 (2026-10-04)
- bumped API version to 4
- implemented new (0.52) cursor API
- added image button component
- tooltips: clear tooltip on UI mode change
- window manager: publicized toAbsolute/toRelative methods
- window handler: added getDefaultStorage method
- window manager: added method to update saved data of a window
- window manager: do not close pinned window unless force flag is passed
- window manager: added getWindow method
- window: fixed pin button disappearing when title changes or window is resized
- compound filter: added a method that filters a list
- sorted list: added defaultColumn option
- column sorter: try selecting default column when currently active column becomes hidden
- column sorter and sorted list: added option for column to start in descending order
- checkbox: added fixed width option
- updated readme a bit

Version 1.2.0 (2026-10-01)
- bumped API version to 3
- list and sorted list: added onListClicked callback
- column list item: fixed error when refreshing columns while some of them are hidden
- cursorMovedThisFrame: fixed detection of whether cursor has moved when using controller
- fixed error that can sometimes occur when list is destroyed
- changed click behavior for lists:
  - triggers on release, not on press
  - does not trigger if released outside of list bounds
  - does not trigger if released over different item than pressed on
- added `lineHeight` and `listRowScale` to Theme.Sizes
- added setting to change `listRowScale` that will affect default line height in sorted lists
- Slider renderer: added roundToStep option
- progress bar: made value clamping optional

Version 1.1.0 (2026-09-25)
- bumped API version to 2
- added option to (set to Auto by default) to make UI look in style of Interface Reimagined
- controller: 
  - fixed wrong icon for default/PSX Right Shoulder
  - fixed rare case where controller hints can remain on screen indefinitely
  - added `setExternalHints` method to allow other mods to show controller hints
- interactive: added `onRClick` callback. Applies also to buttons and checkboxes
- item list/column list:
  - `onItemClicked` will be called only for left-click
  - added `onItemRClicked` that will be called on right-click
  - added `onItemClickedAny` that will be called when any mouse button is clicked on item, receives button in addition to item info
- added ProgressBar component

Version 1.0.1 (2026-09-20)
- tooltips: fixed thrown weapon damage not being doubled
- API: added `cursorMovedThisFrame` method to I.UIToolkit
- API: added new `getCenterPositionForSize` helper method to I.UIToolkit.WindowManager
- windows: improved detection of focused window
- windows: make sure window is not out of bounds on open
- readme: tweaked some tooltip descriptions

Version 1.0.0 (2026-09-19)
- initial release